class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Random\" title=\"Random\">Random</a></b>, any level-appropriate location; <a href=\"/page/Hiding_in_Plain_Sight\" title=\"Hiding in Plain Sight\">Hiding in Plain Sight</a> beneath the large underwater trap\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer the ability to breathe water as if it were air.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Bottle_of_Air.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Bottle_of_Air.png/420px-Bottle_of_Air.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"177\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Bottle_of_Air.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A dark bottle, sealed with a cork.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span>\n<ul><li>This item is a \"Named Item with Non-Unique Location\", which means you have a chance to find this item in any chest at ~Level 3 in the game.</li></ul></li>\n<li>You also can find this item in <a href=\"/page/Hiding_in_Plain_Sight\" title=\"Hiding in Plain Sight\">Hiding in Plain Sight</a>. At the end of underwater part, very deep in the tunnel beneath the large blade trap, you may find either gem, potion of water breathing or this item sitting on the ground.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201343\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.105 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3145/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19369/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5071/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n137.10%  126.525     39 Template:IO\n100.00%   92.287      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   92.287      1 -total\n 94.44%   87.159      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 46.10%   42.548      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 45.17%   41.685      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 44.18%   40.775      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 43.17%   39.837      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.50%   16.152      3 Template:Popup\n 17.49%   16.137      1 T